OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start for most, with
OL,6,Fany early fog patches soon clearing.
OL,7,FCloudier conditions over the Pennines
OL,8,Fat first will spread more widely
OL,9,Fthrough the day, though most places
OL,10,Fwill remain dry and feel warm in any
OL,11,Fsunny spells.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRather cloudy and mainly dry
OL,14,Fthis evening, though one or two
OL,15,Fshowers may break out later overnight.
OL,16,FSome may become heavy around dawn,
OL,17,Fespecially over higher ground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
